    // Phase: 0 enter, 1 runnable, 2 returned, 3 trapped, 4 aborted,
    // 5 terminated, 6 infrastructure failure. Boundary values mirror phase
    // except 1=budget. No guest pointer is ever interpreted as a host address.
    // Caller owns disjoint code/state/stack buffers and admits a verified
    // zero-argument Int64 straight-line function. No full PMF verifier yet.
